# Overcoming Self-Doubt (Short Motivational Script)

**Hook:**  
What if the only thing stopping you… is you?

**Script:**  
Every day, people choose comfort over growth.  
But the truth is—your future is built the moment you stop doubting yourself.  

Every expert was once a beginner.  
Every strong person was once unsure.  

You don’t need to be perfect.  
You just need to start.  
Right now.


